  ], lines: 6, examples: ("drill-164", "drill-164-2")),
  exercise([
    #drill-heading(165)

    The author, in common with many teachers of business writing, has found
    the practice of combinations of capitals very helpful in developing
    accuracy and freedom. This is an excellent part of the course in which to
    introduce such drills, but tangled and difficult combinations should be
    avoided.

    Drill one hundred and sixty-five, if rightly practiced, will insure light
    movement and develop constructive ability. It will be profitable to devote
    a full session to it.

    #instruction[Write "CPR" twenty-two times in 60 seconds.]
